  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A healthy flush of clean color in just one swipe. The creamy, blendable formula melds with skin for a hydrating, natural finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Stick</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and allows for seamless blendability.</p><p>- Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration, moisturizes deeply.</p><p>- Biomimicry Pigment Technology: Mimics the structure of skin’s ceramides for nourishing payoff that lasts.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>Gucci Westman's Tip: Work in a small oval motion blending up and outward as you go.   \n</p><p><br></p><p>For Cheeks: Apply the stick directly to skin or dab onto Westman Atelier Baby Blender Brush or fingers. Gently blend onto the middle of your cheekbone. \n</p><p><br></p><p>For Lips: Pop onto lips for a monochromatic look and juicy pop of color\n</p><p><br></p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >- Jojoba Seed Oil: Improves hydration and allows for seamless blendability. &nbsp;</p><p>- Raspberry Leaf Stem Cell Extract: Boosts hydration, moisturizes deeply.</p><p>- Biomimicry Pigment Technology: Mimics the structure of skin’s ceramides for nourishing payoff that lasts.</p><p><br></p><p>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride Kaolin Caprylyl Caprylate/Caprate Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil Polyethylene Mica Polyhydroxystearic Acid Lecithin Behenylcarbamoylpropyl Polysilsesquioxane Tocopherol Ascorbyl Palmitate Citric Acid Rubus Idaeus Leaf Cell Culture May Contain: Titanium Dioxide Ci 77891 Iron Oxides Ci 77491 Iron Oxides Ci 77492 Iron Oxides Ci 77499 Red 30 Lake Ci 73360 Blue 1 Lake Ci 42090 Red 7 Lake Ci 15850 Yellow 5 Lake Ci 19140</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
