i 77499 Red 30 Lake Ci 73360 Blue 1 Lake Ci 42090 Red 7 Lake Ci 15850 Yellow 5 Lake Ci 19140</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
